Title: BREACH POINT
Author: Marcus Cole
Draft date: June 2026

FADE IN:


INT. EMBASSY ANNEX - SECURITY HUB - NIGHT

Monitors flicker. CAPTAIN RICO SANTOS, 38, exfil specialist, studies thermal feeds. A HOSTAGE COUNT reads 3 in a basement vault.
SANTOS
We breach at 0400. Two minutes in, ninety seconds out.

INT. ROOFTOP STAGING - NIGHT

Santos's team — VEGA, PARK, OSEI — check carbines and breaching charges. A RED FLARE CANISTER clips to Vega's vest.
VEGA
Guard rotation shifts early. We lose the blind spot in six.
SANTOS
Then we don't use the blind spot. We make our own door.

INT. EMBASSY BASEMENT - NIGHT

Charges blow. Smoke. Santos moves low — two guards down, non-lethal. Three HOSTAGES crouch against a steel cage.
SANTOS
Eyes on me. Walk, don't run.

INT. STAIRWELL - NIGHT

Automatic fire tears plaster above them. Park returns fire. Osei shepherds hostages upward. An alarm wails.
PARK
They've locked the street exit!
SANTOS
Roof. Always had a plan B.

EXT. EMBASSY ROOFTOP - NIGHT

Santos pops the RED FLARE. A helicopter crests the skyline. Hostages board first. Santos covers the ladder, last man up.
SANTOS
Count them. All three. Then we celebrate.

FADE OUT.


THE END
